# Route: guide 39 of 49 of the simulator's completionist route for Orc (1199
# of 1215 eligible quests, 157.3 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 56 to 58, 64
# quests, 3.1 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Undercity, Moonglade, Azshara, Feralas, Tirisfal Glades, Alterac
# Mountains, Western Plaguelands): Undercity -> near Undercity -> Undercity ->
# Moonglade -> Ravencrest Monument -> Camp Mojache -> Feral Scar Vale ->
# Grimtotem Compound -> Camp Mojache -> The Twin Colossals -> The Forgotten
# Coast -> The Twin Colossals -> Feral Scar Vale -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): The Star, the Hand and the Heart
# (736; Grel'borg the Miser 39, Dagun the Ravenous 43, Mogh the Undying 44);
# The Crimson Courier (6145; Crimson Courier 60); The Crown of Will (518;
# Crushridge Mauler 36-37).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): The Book of Ur (1013), The Book of Ur (1013), Going,
# Going, Guano! (1109), Going, Going, Guano! (1109), Bring the End (3341), The
# Power to Destroy... (5725), Light's Justice (92421), Light's Justice
# (92421), The New Plague (95216), Source of Power (96988), Pusillin and the
# Elder Azj'Tordin (7441), Elven Legends (7481), Lethtendris's Web (7489),
# Vorrel's Revenge (1051), Barov Family Fortune (5341), The Wrath of Rath'mael
# (92422), The Wrath of Rath'mael (92422), Crest of Lordaeron (95204),
# Unending Torment (97288), Heart of Disruption (96984), The Grave Knight
# (96986), Opportunistic Education (96987), Doctor Theolen Krastinov, the
# Butcher (5382), Kirtonos the Herald (5384), The Lich, Ras Frostwhisper
# (5466), Krastinov's Bag of Horrors (5515), Of Love and Family (5848), Oculus
# Illusions (6569).

